 unlocks special rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Display collections in a museum to earn passive income and show off your finds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Progression and Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151980/extras/ad60c5e028105569761d79fae4c254f5.poster.avif?t=1749860194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151980/extras/ad60c5e028105569761d79fae4c254f5.webm?t=1749860194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151980/extras/ad60c5e028105569761d79fae4c254f5.mp4?t=1749860194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your magnets to handle heavier, more complex objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase boats for deeper water travel and diving suits for manual underwater exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in advanced restoration tools to clean and repair faster and more efficiently.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World &amp; Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d<strong>Diverse Biomes to Discover:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151980/extras/9fc3cd73a2843b218fa5bb415adcc591.poster.avif?t=1749860194\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151980/extras/9fc3cd73a2843b218fa5bb415adcc591.webm?t=1749860194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151980/extras/9fc3cd